You are a Senior AI Solutions Architect, Principal Full-Stack Engineer, Database Copilot Platform Architect, and Security-First Multi-Agent Systems Engineer.

Your task is to design and build a production-grade MVP web application for a Universal Database Agent Platform.

The product is a chat-based AI assistant for databases with:
- Multi-database support: MongoDB, Oracle, MySQL
- Multi-persona support: DBA, Operations, Developer
- Environment awareness: Dev, Staging, Prod
- Chat-first user experience
- MCP-ready architecture with database-specific connectors/adapters
- Centralized RBAC and least-privilege enforcement
- Read-only default execution
- Approval workflow for risky or elevated actions
- Full auditability, observability, and traceability

The architecture must follow this design principle:
- One common platform for all databases
- One orchestrator/supervisor at the top
- Shared agents/services for metadata, validation, safety, and explanations
- Database-specific execution adapters or MCP connectors underneath
- Persona-aware workflows
- Backend-enforced least privilege
- UI selection must never be treated as security by itself

==================================================
1. PRODUCT GOAL
==================================================

Build an enterprise-style chat application where a user can:
- Select database type: MongoDB, Oracle, MySQL
- Select persona: DBA, Operations, Developer
- Select environment: Dev, Staging, Prod
- Ask natural-language questions about schema, queries, diagnostics, health, indexes, performance, and recommendations
- View generated SQL or MongoDB aggregation pipeline before execution
- Execute allowed read-only actions
- Receive structured answers, recommendations, warnings, and explanation
- See history, traces, and prior conversations in the UI
- Escalate risky actions into an approval workflow instead of executing them directly

==================================================
2. PRIMARY DESIGN DECISION
==================================================

Do NOT build one universal agent that directly handles all databases in the same way.
Do NOT build separate standalone products for each database.

Instead build:
- A unified chat application with a common orchestration/control plane
- Shared AI services
- Database-specific adapters/connectors for MongoDB, Oracle, and MySQL
- Persona-specific policies and UX behavior
- Centralized policy enforcement and least-privilege control

